WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Open Edit text on a PDF with editable text.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Select the text box you want to change.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Update the wording directly on the page.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Click outside the box to review your changes.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Apply changes. Check the result before exporting.
